### Health / metadados
GET http://127.0.0.1:3333/health

### Lista todas as massas (documentos, senhas e resumo)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3333/api/v1/massas

### Validar documento sem autenticar
POST http://127.0.0.1:3333/api/v1/documentos/validar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "documento": "12.ABC.345/01DE-35" }

### Autenticar com CPF
POST http://127.0.0.1:3333/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "documento": "432.520.270-62", "senha": "Vivo@0062" }

### Autenticar com CNPJ numerico
POST http://127.0.0.1:3333/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "documento": "91.863.013/0002-20" }

### Autenticar com CNPJ alfanumerico
POST http://127.0.0.1:3333/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "documento": "V6.6VW.DP0/40QP-63" }

### Consultar dividas (troque <TOKEN> pelo access_token recebido)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3333/api/v1/consulta
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
